Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.65,0:01:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:49.82,0:01:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To Icy-Tail's first show as a headliner!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.30,0:01:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.79,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo's treating us, so it's all you can eat!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.52,0:02:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiter!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.58,0:02:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have 10 servings of your best beef tongue, short ribs, pork loin and tripe!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You best slow the heck down!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.60,0:02:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, man.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.04,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't solo concerts the absolute best?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.65,0:02:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! They all came just to see us!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And so many at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:15.07,0:02:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There was so much space in the dressing room!\NNormally we can barely breathe!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:19.28,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That's what stood out to you?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.45,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:24.49,0:02:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Our promotion for our new game was a super success too!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.21,0:02:32.68,Default,TM,0,0,0,,Ah, it's all thanks to your hard work, Izumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.25,0:02:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it took me until ten this morning to finish the key visual?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.01,0:02:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It really made setting up the merch a race against the clock.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.99,0:02:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked yourself to death for the circle.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:47.73,0:02:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As fellow circle members,\Nit's only natural for us to cover for each other.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:52.69,0:02:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.32,0:02:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, considering we are all busy with our jobs,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:59.61,0:03:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,any potential problems would come from the one who lazes about and does nothing, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.47,0:03:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Katou?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you referring to me, by any chance?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:08.96,0:03:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not by chance.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor had I intended to be ambiguous.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.85,0:03:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:16.25,0:03:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm not the type to do what any other person could.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.35,0:03:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was of the mind that circle members should help each other.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:24.73,0:03:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well if that's your take,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:26.06,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like you are painfully unaware of how meticulous my plans truly were.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:29.48,0:03:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be fully aware of that before attempting to criticize me.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:38.83,0:03:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Michiru.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.39,0:03:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:41.46,0:03:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't those two getting along?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to know that?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:46.62,0:03:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are desperate if you're asking Micchi of all people.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.82,0:03:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the last person who'd get it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she can't participate in the sweetheart scuffle.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.38,0:03:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first I'm hearing of this kind of war and I'd like an explanation please!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.92,0:04:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now, Katou?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.84,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my marketing genius,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.93,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the official Twitter account has received over five thousand retweets.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.15,0:04:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, my advertising has reached
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.85,0:04:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,ten times the amount of people who attended today's concert.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.23,0:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think simple advertising can be considered a contribution to game development.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.55,0:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then by proxy, selling merchandise at a concert
Dialogue: 99,0:04:24.65,0:04:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't contributing to game development either, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.06,0:04:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning, it's burning!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't put that much pork offal on there!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Katou sure has changed, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:34.86,0:04:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.08,0:04:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that we were always the most conspicuous in the TV series,
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.67,0:04:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't get used to being\Na minor character in this movie at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.27,0:04:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how it goes.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:47.88,0:04:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't members of the circle anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.49,0:04:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're probably way lower in the credits too.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.02,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming today, \NEriri and Kasumigaoka.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.08,0:05:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no worries! Thanks for the invitation!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:07.02,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it going?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.42,0:05:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, well, the job is pure hell.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.50,0:05:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But Fields Chronicles is\Na really hyped-up project, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:16.37,0:05:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In spite of Kasumigaoka writing the scenario, somehow.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:21.34,0:05:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we still get along great.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are as close as ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.95,0:05:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you blind? We're fighting as usual!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.39,0:05:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, you all have become pretty close as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:33.77,0:05:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:35.02,0:05:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.05,0:05:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when have you and Hashima argued so much?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.80,0:05:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't everything that infiltrates the circle \Nget properly disinfected or something like that?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:48.41,0:05:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been useful, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That the all-important Sawamura was born yesterday.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:53.24,0:05:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that supposed to mean!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ethical.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here for a second.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Utaha...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.90,0:06:08.34,Default,QC,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we've seen each other.\NLet's have a nice, long chat.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.34,0:06:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... I mean...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:11.32,0:06:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget about that thing from back then.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It may have been my first time,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't regret it one bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.56,0:06:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, please stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:22.82,0:06:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I was trying to forget!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:25.93,0:06:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Megumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.28,Alternative,,0,0,0,,I said no more!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman! You won't believe her!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:46.42,0:06:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, Katou, I can explain.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.57,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you stop teasing Eriri for now?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:54.35,0:06:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you two friends who are doing their very best even now?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.64,0:07:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're sticking to your guns, just a me-and-her problem, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:02.47,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, if all that is true,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems like we have quite a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please go over there, Aki?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:17.75,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been well?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was fine until just now.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it too late?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you may regret it,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.22,0:07:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,you've left a deep scar on my heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.35,0:07:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You were my first, that'll never change.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.39,0:07:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't regret anything until you spilled the beans!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.68,0:07:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is persistent!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.61,0:07:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgraceful, a university student still clinging to a high school kid.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming from the one who's obsessed with the guy she betrayed twice!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.72,0:07:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's taking the cake when it comes to disgrace!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.85,0:07:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!\NBeen forgiven twice too, after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:51.44,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems more like you reset your relationship progress!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:57.73,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You two haven't grown a bit!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.37,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So, how's Blessing Software's new game coming along?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.92,0:08:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait and see, you two!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:10.63,0:08:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to create it with my own two hands!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:13.37,0:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A dating sim able to set everyone's heart aflutter!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.43,0:08:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Writing the script for all five heroines is pretty ambitious, plus it's only your second game.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:23.69,0:08:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially since you were just \Nanother 2D freak a year ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.94,0:08:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well that hasn't changed at all, has it.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:31.40,0:08:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, um, um!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.78,0:08:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya may be a 2D freak but he wrote a truly great script!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:38.53,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I get all excited every time he finishes a new bit!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.42,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What should the composition of that CG be like?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.55,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I convey the emotions of that scene, and so on!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.04,0:08:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still some things that are bothering me though!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:50.38,0:08:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, could the cliché blonde, twin-tailed heroine...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.84,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and the long black-haired one...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.30,0:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,not just be dropped?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.18,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, the underclassman heroine's laudability \Nand cuteness can compensate for that.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.00,0:09:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a great script top to bottom!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.46,Default,TM,0,0,0,,You actually think my script is that good?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.94,Default,TM,0,0,0,,And it's not like that's all there is!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:09.94,0:09:16.92,Default,TM,0,0,0,,Michiru's music, Megumi's direction, and of course, my art, will be perfect complements to it!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:17.63,0:09:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So you two, when working on a big-budget title,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:21.94,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,one delay after another could\Nvery well have it cancelled.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.04,0:09:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't come crying, all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.04,0:09:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one crying here!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.96,0:09:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not mincing your words, Hashima Izumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.49,0:09:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't say I dislike the reckless way you're checking us.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.34,0:09:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you swear it?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.13,0:09:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That your game will become\Na masterpiece that won't lose against ours?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:45.18,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're far beyond that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:47.04,0:09:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't underestimate our ability to cooperate when necessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.34,0:10:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to get started with, Kousaka?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.59,0:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How much common sense do you have to lack to actually come here?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.70,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I am trying to give you feedback as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you had until end of day.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.94,0:10:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You went ahead and handed it in at lunchtime, now we're here.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.87,0:10:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We had important plans, so we tried to manage our time as well as possible!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:32.61,0:10:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? That didn't work out for you then.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it to yourself, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.93,0:10:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, obviously.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong! It should be like this!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.00,0:10:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.20,0:10:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't look good on screen!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That armour might as well be paper!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.63,0:10:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did what you said,\Nthe designs would all be crazy generic!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider some form of balance\Nfor one minute please!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It stands out way too much!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.79,0:10:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in charge of design, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:59.98,0:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So shut up and let me be in charge!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.92,0:11:04.76,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Kousaka Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:01.92,0:11:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't reached that level yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:04.47,0:11:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Rethink it!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.02,0:11:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you hear that, Iori?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.11,0:11:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're in Akihabara.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:12.91,0:11:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've told her countless times that she \Nshouldn't talk about business around here.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Some spoilers are bound to get out like this...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.04,0:11:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, can you not take pictures or send them around?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:24.09,0:11:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel nothing! Nothing! This event is way too weak!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:27.62,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tolerance is what's weak here!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop babbling and start eating please!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.90,0:11:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the scene where Filene dies!\N That's the first half's climax!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.28,0:11:40.72,Alternative,,0,0,0,,So we're spoiling the events right before the climax now?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:40.72,0:11:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who doesn't get it!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:42.87,0:11:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The repressed nature of that scene is what makes its impact all the greater!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.91,0:11:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Having all the tearjerker scenes play out in the same way will only make the players bored!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then keep sharpening them!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:53.48,0:11:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Until they become razors to tear a player's heart apart!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.25,0:12:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't do that, it's nothing but a pretentious failure!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:00.31,0:12:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.31,0:12:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.78,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are disturbing the other customers.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:06.60,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:09.26,0:12:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cover all the other tables as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You get me, yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:15.18,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stuff yourselves and forget everything you've seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.60,0:12:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have the best beef tongue, short ribs, pork loin and tripe! Bring it all on!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.26,0:13:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry. I'm not really hungry.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.21,0:13:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you go to bed?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:40.97,0:13:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I wanted to stay up until everyone was here, but you know...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:47.27,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And how is progress?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.85,0:13:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the main heroine route remains.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You proclaimed that you'd easily finish it during summer break.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When in July was that again?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.25,0:14:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, just a while ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.98,0:14:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And when will summer break end?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.99,0:14:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, just a bit later.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:08.36,0:14:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't Izumi's work get stalled\Nwaiting for you at this rate?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.93,0:14:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry okay?\NI didn't ask to be in a slump.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you working on?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:19.62,0:14:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguri's fifteenth scene.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.58,0:14:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, even an amateur like me can see how important this one is.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:27.76,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! It's the player's entrance into her route!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.03,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, it's the game's most important junction! Its very core!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot let this slip!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:38.71,0:14:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.04,0:14:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to weave every scene together to form my most impactful story ever!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.94,0:14:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:48.45,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any ideas for breaking out of this writer's block?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:52.16,0:14:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you be asking me that?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.47,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to grasp at every straw I can!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.45,0:14:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm drowning here!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.73,0:15:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't sound like you need me,\Nbut maybe I'm just imagining things.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.76,0:15:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, let's see.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.99,0:15:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You could experience and learn from other works.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.01,0:15:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah yes, we stand on the\Nshoulders of giants after all!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:14.06,0:15:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You could try putting pen to paper\Nwithout any restraint.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.10,0:15:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,True, 100kb of crap is still better than 0kb of absolute genius!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:23.39,0:15:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you could just forget it all and take a break.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.29,0:15:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And with some luck, elves would finish everything during my sleep!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:31.81,0:15:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, I think we're long past the point where we could try that.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm at a loss here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:40.59,0:15:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why grasp at a straw like me instead of praying to your writing goddess?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.95,0:15:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.65,0:15:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have dealt with your problems countless times, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like her.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:57.69,0:16:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I ask her for advice, won't you get mad?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:02.39,0:16:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.73,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, considering what\Nhappened at the restaurant...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.19,0:16:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she isn't a part of the circle anymore, she'd probably still be willing to help us.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.25,0:16:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up just a minute!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:20.10,0:16:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly you understand your face is telling a totally different story!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.49,0:16:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, either way.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.44,0:16:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyoudo and Izumi should be arriving soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:30.68,0:16:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go wash your face.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.26,0:16:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:09.99,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.13,0:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame, your Kasumi Utako is gone.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.02,0:17:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What brought you here today?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I received a revised script this morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My feedback has to be delivered quickly.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.35,0:17:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have called in advance, at least.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:29.88,0:17:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Says the guy loitering in front of her apartment.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.59,0:17:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a stalker.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.36,0:17:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are clingy for a guy who's been tossed aside.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.96,0:17:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing as the group leader, but as a man...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:41.71,0:17:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what it was about!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:43.31,0:17:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted her advice for my script.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:46.38,0:17:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear such things from you of all people.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered Kashiwagi Eri and Kasumi Utako.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:54.76,0:17:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Their books were already flying off the shelves.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.52,0:17:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.10,0:18:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You clearly stole my idea of having them collaborate on a game!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:07.98,0:18:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so cold to your patron.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:11.11,0:18:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.28,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You were Enaka?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I brought you all the way to the Nasu Plateau.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:20.89,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the night at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That time was…
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.88,0:18:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed four whole deadlines, you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how much the editor cried after that?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:30.33,0:18:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm s-sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:32.72,0:18:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:34.19,0:18:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean you wanted to poach Eriri when you saw her art back then?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:38.12,0:18:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:40.49,0:18:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So you could say I was your pest all along!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:47.14,0:18:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get out! Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.52,0:18:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, gotcha! I'm sick of driving too,\Nso let's grab a bite.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.73,0:19:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Kousaka?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.19,0:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it, I'm concentrating.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.68,0:19:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, are you actually reading?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:11.17,0:19:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm not skipping a single word.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:13.73,0:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not humanly possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.73,0:19:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:21.68,0:19:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're obviously not laughing with my script here!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:25.82,0:19:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This script is hella gross!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.15,0:19:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially that blonde heroine who bursts into tears from a simple kiss!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.11,0:19:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how pure can you be?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.68,0:19:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll barely see that kinda stuff in 2D these days!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.14,0:19:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you not attack every little flaw?!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop. Please stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:47.95,0:19:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the long black-haired one is way too inconsistent!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.91,0:19:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a total sadist the whole time,
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.09,0:19:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but as soon as she gets in bed,\Nshe's quiet as a mouse!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:56.69,0:19:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just lying there, okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.55,0:20:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing more to it!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.51,0:20:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what's:
Dialogue: 99,0:20:01.93,0:20:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,“L-Listen, this is my f-first time.” supposed to mean in this scene?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.39,0:20:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't read it out loud!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.24,0:20:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is your main route?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.24,0:20:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still a work in progress.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.41,0:20:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:33.06,0:20:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to show it any mercy!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:38.49,0:20:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown quite a bit in this short time, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:42.38,0:20:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The sub routes and this are like chalk and cheese!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:45.82,0:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That greasy and unrefined style of the sub heroine routes,
Dialogue: 99,0:20:48.89,0:20:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is smoothing out now that you've reached the main route.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:53.10,0:20:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd grow this fast.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.90,0:20:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why amateurs who learn the ropes are so scary.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:59.07,0:21:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.71,0:21:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I felt totally lost about the direction I was going!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:04.02,0:21:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt like something was off. \NMaybe because I was in a slump?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I actually grew!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:10.28,0:21:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't take a turn for the worse, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.13,0:21:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words were the final push I needed to–
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.06,0:21:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:20.00,0:21:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,such an idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NClearly you got lost!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:25.88,0:21:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally fell into a slump!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.52,0:21:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally held back!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't, this wouldn't have been anything other than worthless!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.39,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've refined your writing so much it's turned dull!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:37.77,0:21:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This script looks like it's about to put on a polo and play golf!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.35,0:21:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you holding back?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:41.71,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not you!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.98,0:21:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But, didn't you say the sub routes and this were like chalk and cheese?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.95,0:21:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,As if some foul cheese is comparable to some perfectly white chalk!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.42,0:21:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember Cherry Blessing?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:57.04,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote that happy-go-lucky route, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:00.60,0:22:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasumi Utako would never write something that corny.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.55,0:22:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got the same vibe as the first half of this, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:07.52,0:22:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.37,0:22:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But even I couldn't write this.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:13.72,0:22:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got something special.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kousaka...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:17.94,0:22:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't your forte the discharge of your appallingly gross nerd fantasies?!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.60,0:22:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your readers get goosebumps, \Nget embarrassed and want to look away.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.24,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But they can't put it down!\NThat's what you've got!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you praise it without calling it gross?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:30.99,0:22:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll definitely have a cult following of disgusting nerds.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:34.13,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to improve!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:35.90,0:22:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Go all-out degenerate!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.52,0:22:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep releasing your shitty fantasies!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:40.09,0:22:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Flirt all you want with the suspiciously easy heroines!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:42.85,0:22:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that just...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:44.46,0:22:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Masturbate!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:46.84,0:22:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Masturbate, boy!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:49.04,0:22:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Masturbate as hard as you can!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.26,0:22:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Masturbate so nobody can\Ntear their eyes away from it!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.08,0:22:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Masturbate shamefully, but proudly!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.65,0:22:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With all your might!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:01.56,0:23:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.59,0:23:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:09.44,0:23:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna head back to Kasumi Utako's?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.83,0:23:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:14.70,0:23:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guess this is goodbye then.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:20.83,0:23:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Kousaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:24.42,0:23:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For today, uh, well...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me a copy if you manage to finish.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:29.64,0:23:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grab it at Winter Comiket.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:32.45,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:42.01,0:23:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! You shouldn't be driving, take a taxi!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.16,0:23:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Katou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.65,0:23:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't understand what "it" is. At all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:52.78,0:23:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of my slump!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:54.46,0:23:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't gross enough until now!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:57.60,0:23:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to masturbate a lot more!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:03.04,0:24:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry, that was inappropriate.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:04.88,0:24:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I wanted to say was:{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:06.67,0:24:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to release my personal fantasies way more!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:10.87,0:24:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean writing even grosser stuff than before?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:15.11,0:24:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I'll be able to stand that.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:17.60,0:24:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}True, a girl might not be able to!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:19.84,0:24:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But men like me are going to love it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.26,0:24:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It sets their hearts aflutter!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:24.65,0:24:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely did.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:26.63,0:24:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely became my worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:29.14,0:24:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Before I can tackle fifteen,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:31.96,0:24:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll rewrite all of Meguri's scenes from one to fourteen for now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:35.78,0:24:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what day is it today?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:39.18,0:24:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uh, the 31st of August.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:42.62,0:24:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And, when is summer break over?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.78,0:24:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The 31st of August.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.21,0:24:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And, one more thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:49.45,0:24:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nope!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Homework or the placement test\Npost-break is irrelevant!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:52.69,0:24:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm dead set on finishing the game this year!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:24:56.15,0:24:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We're third years, we have entrance exams you know.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:58.97,0:25:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sending you the script for now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:00.94,0:25:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Skype me when you're done.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:02.63,0:25:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We can talk while looking it over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.63,0:25:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Aki, do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.98,0:25:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm available at any time!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:10.08,0:25:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Later!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.61,0:25:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I read it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:21.37,0:25:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually called me today.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:23.83,0:25:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll hang up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:24.43,0:25:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I apologize! Praise Lady Katou! Lady Megumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:26.95,0:25:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, uh, let's start by\Nrunning through the script.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:29.88,0:25:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, this event has a problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:32.97,0:25:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Namely, the protagonist's behaviour, speech and attitude.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:36.09,0:25:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, everything.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Total rejection?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:39.05,0:25:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No woman would sympathize with such an egoistically wilful man.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:45.45,0:25:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But this is a male fantasy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.70,0:25:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This sort of protagonist triggers a woman's maternal instincts.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:51.38,0:25:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They go all "Ah, guess I gotta." lovey-dovey.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.78,0:25:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In reality, you'd break up with that guy with an "I gotta."
Dialogue: 99,0:25:58.57,0:26:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you this story isn't real!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:00.41,0:26:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a male fantasy!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.69,0:26:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then,
Dialogue: 99,0:26:04.71,0:26:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a limit to what you can do.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:07.29,0:26:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Y-You think so?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:08.75,0:26:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should cuddle up to your heroine a bit more.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:12.33,0:26:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She deserves some love, even if it's here and there.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:18.08,0:26:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, what should I do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:20.01,0:26:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's something you have to figure out on your own.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:24.63,0:26:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're harsh, huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:27.66,0:26:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rejected.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:28.78,0:26:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:29.94,0:26:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come on.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.64,0:26:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's the last event before they can choose to enter her route, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:36.11,0:26:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:37.50,0:26:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, look.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:38.99,0:26:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have to plant the seed of love inside Meguri in this event, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:45.83,0:26:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Such a run-of-the-mill situation raising one of her flags is unrealistic.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:51.41,0:26:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, because of that,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:53.86,0:26:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you would have entered her route already.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:26:57.31,0:26:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:59.33,0:27:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I reject this scene entirely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:02.77,0:27:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should, well, rethink your current approach.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:07.44,0:27:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't ever change it.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:10.40,0:27:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my favourite scene in the entire script.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:15.56,0:27:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I adore it.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:20.21,0:27:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then you shouldn't ask me for advice.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:23.06,0:27:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe it would be better to write it alone?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:28.17,0:27:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, Katou.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:30.08,0:27:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cheer up a bit, please.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:32.26,0:27:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? I'm not upset at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:35.62,0:27:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can we talk about Meguri's fifteenth scene?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:39.24,0:27:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I only have outlines from here on out,\N but I would love to hear what you think.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:43.19,0:27:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:45.92,0:27:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You could just write whatever pleases you.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.84,0:27:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:50.39,0:27:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This has to be my best script yet!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:54.23,0:27:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And that can't happen without you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:27:58.73,0:28:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are selfish and persistent, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:04.58,0:28:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:06.90,0:28:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, I would definitely approach this scene a bit differently.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:11.23,0:28:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:12.65,0:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.54,0:28:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Something incredibly sad for the couple happens and the protagonist is crying.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:18.42,0:28:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess making him cry isn't it then?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:23.11,0:28:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Triggering one of her flags like that would be weird.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:29.38,0:28:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm talking about her.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:33.00,0:28:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't be hugging him.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:35.45,0:28:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:36.97,0:28:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:38.36,0:28:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But then a flag wouldn't be triggered at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:42.45,0:28:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally wrong here.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:45.91,0:28:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Her flag was triggered long ago.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:48.38,0:28:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just allow the protagonist to cry his heart out.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:53.57,0:28:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But will the player get it?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:28:56.62,0:29:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't, they'd never choose her route.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:02.55,0:29:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:04.66,0:29:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right, if that's what you think I'll look it over.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:09.47,0:29:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:12.29,0:29:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:13.38,0:29:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Katou, did you–{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:14.94,0:29:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:16.52,0:29:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,After that event, they start calling each other by their first names, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:20.75,0:29:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah, yeah, in the game.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:24.95,0:29:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then shouldn't we, too?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:27.61,0:29:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, I guess so.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:30.80,0:29:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:33.04,0:29:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.39,0:29:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to write some more before going to bed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:37.79,0:29:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Later, Megumi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.32,0:29:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Later, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:50.21,0:29:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,0:29:53.85,0:29:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is it, Tomoya?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:29:55.91,0:29:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can hang up if you want to.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:58.60,0:30:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can stay awake too, right?\NAnd watch you, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:30:02.67,0:30:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:04.46,0:30:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told you it's fine. Don't worry about me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:30:07.95,0:30:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But I am.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:17.56,0:30:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Goodnight.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:30:27.16,0:30:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,G-Good morning, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:37.76,0:30:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:41.60,0:30:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You answered!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:43.60,0:30:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.45,0:30:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might react like in April.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.07,0:30:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You laughed and just acted all mysterious.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:50.00,0:30:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember that.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:51.72,0:30:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to remember that one bit.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:54.79,0:30:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally reacted that way!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:56.85,0:30:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't hold back from laughing when you saw my new glasses!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:59.91,0:31:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go back to calling you Aki?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:02.93,0:31:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:04.54,0:31:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be much more respectful from now on, Megumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:08.12,0:31:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Same for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:12.05,0:31:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So when did you get up today?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.89,0:31:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I actually pulled an all-nighter.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:16.72,0:31:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomo–
Dialogue: 99,0:31:20.65,0:31:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Those two seem...
Dialogue: 99,0:31:24.52,0:31:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Megumi, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:27.19,0:31:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:29.13,0:31:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Morning, Eriri.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:31.93,0:31:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe geniuses don't need to read the mood after all.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:40.70,0:31:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally finished Meguri fifteen!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:43.82,0:31:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you haven't written in a month, \Nit only took a single night once you got going.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:48.10,0:31:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my best script so far and\Na combination of our souls.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:53.01,0:31:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please never forget it!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:54.80,0:31:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your iced coffee! Hope you enjoy!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:06.89,0:32:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to take me a while, \Nso you can do something else.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:10.51,0:32:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:11.66,0:32:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give it your full attention.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:22.31,0:32:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:23.72,0:32:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So embarrassing that I want to look away.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:26.45,0:32:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:27.42,0:32:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a compliment.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:28.84,0:32:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If even a girl is embarrassed,\Nthe guys' hearts will surely go wild!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:33.61,0:32:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Katou!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:35.30,0:32:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said that it wasn't a compliment.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:39.31,0:32:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not Katou.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:41.81,0:32:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:44.44,0:32:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? How are you going to\Ndeal with the next events?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.43,0:32:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:50.02,0:32:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguri and the protagonist finally got together.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:52.98,0:32:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After that...
Dialogue: 99,0:32:53.88,0:32:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Meguri lose her memories, or will the protagonist die?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:57.88,0:33:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget what kind of game this is?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:02.10,0:33:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't. I just wanted to.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.76,0:33:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The heroine's charm has\Nto be present in every pixel!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:09.04,0:33:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, the next step is clear.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:11.30,0:33:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to flirt and make out like crazy!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:15.59,0:33:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I thought so.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:17.45,0:33:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are we doing it again?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:19.43,0:33:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:20.29,0:33:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, we don't have to if you're tired.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:23.65,0:33:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:25.74,0:33:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Um.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:28.24,0:33:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for our game, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:30.82,0:33:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:33.83,0:33:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what came from last night's session.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:37.87,0:33:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.08,0:33:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their first lovey-dovey event after finally getting together.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:43.75,0:33:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean there will be\Na second and third one too?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:47.74,0:33:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about that once this is done.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:51.24,0:33:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The part I want you to look at today is this.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:57.76,0:34:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At that moment, Meguri's body shook a little in surprise.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:02.55,0:34:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonetheless, after a short while,\Nher tiny hand tightly entwined with mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.54,0:34:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides us, there were many people on the platform waiting for their trains.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:13.33,0:34:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With us, a brand new couple, among them.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:16.11,0:34:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We both endured the harmless, heartwarming rush with all our might.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:20.82,0:34:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You've shown me this inordinately embarassing portion of the script.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:25.49,0:34:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me now?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:27.76,0:34:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What do you think about her reaction?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:30.85,0:34:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's incredibly adorable.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:33.36,0:34:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you wanted to ask me?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.67,0:34:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I could convey it\Nway better with your input.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.09,0:34:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons of options for the heroine's lines.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.49,0:34:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want me to think of them?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:46.39,0:34:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping it'd feel more real\Nreading it on a platform.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:54.65,0:34:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand that stuff.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:56.92,0:34:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm just asking–
Dialogue: 99,0:35:04.25,0:35:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't try it, I won't understand it.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:12.46,0:35:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What an old-school event.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:15.35,0:35:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Male gamers like this stuff.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:18.80,0:35:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this certainly is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:22.51,0:35:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I know right!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:24.11,0:35:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But shouldn't it be something a little bit more special?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:28.60,0:35:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, how?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:31.24,0:35:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:32.76,0:35:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can do it like lovers?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:36.47,0:35:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:39.17,0:35:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.62,0:35:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, like that.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:45.29,0:35:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm kind of the main heroine.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:48.87,0:35:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this quite intimate though?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:52.16,0:35:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:53.67,0:35:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you do something far more intimate with someone else?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:57.38,0:35:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to bring that up now?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:59.68,0:36:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You even kissed, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:02.32,0:36:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3688)}Hold on, this conversation isn't necessary to improve the script!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:09.36,0:36:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know what to do next?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:11.12,0:36:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.{\u1}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:12.05,0:36:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From Meguri twenty, there are two possible courses of action.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:16.41,0:36:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the first?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:17.90,0:36:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Taking a page out of the Chinese book with Kishoutenketsu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:20.46,0:36:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want to put in a twist?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:23.11,0:36:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. Like having Meguri lose her memories or having the protagonist die.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:27.76,0:36:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 99,0:36:29.00,0:36:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Look, I think we've brought out her charm well enough up to this point.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:33.37,0:36:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, going in a different direction wouldn't be a problem, maybe?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:36.54,0:36:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Though we would need to\Nsmooth out the edges.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:40.59,0:36:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. And the second course?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:44.55,0:36:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}To move on without a twist.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:46.89,0:36:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just let them continue their lovey-dovey life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:50.85,0:36:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the very end?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.15,0:36:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Until the very end.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:36:55.57,0:37:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Today's players might be happier with\N a half-hearted ending like that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:00.66,0:37:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it feels a bit lacking considering the story's overall balance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:05.66,0:37:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's lacking.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:08.48,0:37:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:09.37,0:37:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering a relationship with your crush takes a lot of courage.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:14.24,0:37:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how to feel about you going around \Nand calling it half-hearted, to be honest.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:19.59,0:37:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, you think it doesn't need a twist?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.08,0:37:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:23.00,0:37:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:24.23,0:37:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:26.39,0:37:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right then, let's do it that way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:28.98,0:37:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Pushing aside the seriousness and focusing solely on flirting, dating and embracing each other!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:33.46,0:37:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. Do your best.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:36.69,0:37:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Guess we have the tone for our next location scouting.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:40.27,0:37:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Saturday, September 23rd, 1:00 PM in Ikebukuro.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:45.21,0:37:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's wander around a bit and think about the coming events.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:47.74,0:37:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you the details later,\Nso we're done for today–
Dialogue: 99,0:37:51.20,0:37:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait a second!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:53.04,0:37:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You want to do something with me on a Saturday?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:37:56.71,0:37:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you have plans already?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:58.96,0:38:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's not it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.78,0:38:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't have any plans that day.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:05.09,0:38:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But you know what that day is, right?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:10.53,0:38:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Your birthday.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:12.89,0:38:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll do some location scouting?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:14.98,0:38:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.61,0:38:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or won't we?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:18.85,0:38:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you prefer?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:20.80,0:38:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's an unfair question.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:22.73,0:38:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So will you come even if it's something else?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Definitely.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.32,0:38:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be coming no matter what it's for.\N I'm looking forward to it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:36.61,0:38:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:38.17,0:38:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.81,0:38:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know, not at all!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:48.26,0:38:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Whatever could it possibly be?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:38:51.26,0:38:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean–
Dialogue: 99,0:39:40.85,0:39:44.43,Default,TM,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Megumi.\NI can't make it today after all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:44.43,0:39:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's hard to explain.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:47.28,0:39:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it's a life or death situation!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:50.18,0:39:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll call you later to explain further.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:39:52.65,0:39:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll contact, report, and follow up for sure!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:40:29.91,0:40:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:34.03,0:40:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri, Utaha.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:54.49,0:40:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Her business card?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:56.41,0:40:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We met by chance and exchanged them.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.75,0:41:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She suddenly collapsed in front of a corner store.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:02.34,0:41:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't have any ID.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:05.35,0:41:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my business card was in her pocket.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:09.82,0:41:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That woman goes around without her credit card, license or anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:14.25,0:41:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing she's always got is cash.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.09,0:41:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And? What did the doctor say?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:20.48,0:41:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They said she had a stroke.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:25.42,0:41:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't speak properly when the ambulance arrived.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.79,0:41:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But she seems to be slowly improving in that regard, at least.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:33.15,0:41:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At least?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:36.96,0:41:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They said she can't move her right hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:40.18,0:41:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:41.85,0:41:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an artist, and she draws manga!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:44.94,0:41:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her ultimate, most precious asset!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:47.44,0:41:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, she can likely draw again once she recovered properly.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:51.30,0:41:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she doesn't?
Dialogue: 99,0:41:53.49,0:41:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How can an artist continue her battle if you take away her tools?!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:58.03,0:41:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri...
Dialogue: 99,0:41:59.27,0:42:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the best art–
Dialogue: 99,0:42:00.98,0:42:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a monster on the\Nsame level as me!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:04.81,0:42:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance losing it all at once might break her spirit!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:10.76,0:42:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even know whether she'll recover or not.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.67,0:42:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Being so serious about it won't get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:16.83,0:42:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we can only pray for her recovery.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:20.61,0:42:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how long it takes.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:22.55,0:42:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Fields Chronicle?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:24.77,0:42:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have unlimited time.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:27.57,0:42:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, ours and Kousaka's work is practically done.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:32.43,0:42:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few touches remain before we're ready for the master.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:35.78,0:42:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:38.10,0:42:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "just a few touches"?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:40.64,0:42:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't been informed about the other side's progress!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:44.52,0:42:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:45.08,0:42:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sawamura...
Dialogue: 99,0:42:46.52,0:42:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor do we know how many revisions our work needs.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:51.29,0:42:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kousaka Akane handled all the communication between us and Mars.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:54.89,0:42:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:57.95,0:43:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was to avoid any unnecessary distractions for the staff.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.47,0:43:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She protected us so we could completely dedicate ourselves to our work.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:08.28,0:43:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it wasn't\Nthe way we wanted to do things.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:12.23,0:43:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it's inevitably backfired now.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:21.66,0:43:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prepare everything for Akane's hospitalization.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:25.36,0:43:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back after.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:26.83,0:43:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even that's part of your job, Machida?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.12,0:43:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have a ton of colleagues,\Nbut she doesn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:33.87,0:43:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor does she get along\Nwith her parents, it seems.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:35.75,0:43:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I can certainly see why.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:38.32,0:43:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Kousaka Akane wouldn't want to hear that from you of all people.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:42.01,0:43:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you should all head home now.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:45.46,0:43:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You've still got work to do, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.51,0:43:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're missing our leader.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:50.92,0:43:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to continue?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:52.92,0:43:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:54.44,0:43:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check in with Mars regarding Fields Chronicle.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:59.00,0:44:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, me and Hashima.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.82,0:44:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashima?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:03.78,0:44:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been acquaintances for a long time,
Dialogue: 99,0:44:05.75,0:44:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and he has her complete trust.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:08.33,0:44:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please fill him in on your current situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:13.93,0:44:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to working with you,
Dialogue: 99,0:44:16.07,0:44:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kashiwagi Eri.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:17.60,0:44:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one guy I didn't want to work with.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:20.59,0:44:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what'll happen next.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.71,0:44:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wouldn't mess with any of Akane's team.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:27.92,0:44:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, I'm a part of Blessing Software.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:31.77,0:44:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be returning to my circle's activities as soon as this is over.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:37.44,0:44:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go back now!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:39.49,0:44:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need your help one bit!
Dialogue: 99,0:44:43.91,0:44:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she seems stable.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:46.92,0:44:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, at least.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:49.55,0:44:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do much more at the moment.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:52.94,0:44:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I head over now–
Dialogue: 99,0:44:55.18,0:44:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:57.21,0:45:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's too late, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:01.53,0:45:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,See you at the circle meeting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:04.81,0:45:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry we couldn't celebrate your birthday, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:09.53,0:45:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:12.55,0:45:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:22.74,0:45:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday, Katou!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:24.95,0:45:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it's belated,
Dialogue: 99,0:45:26.41,0:45:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a good one, Katou!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:29.59,0:45:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:31.76,0:45:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:37.06,0:45:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you so much, everyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:39.60,0:45:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:40.68,0:45:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hold the meeting while digging into that cake!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:43.45,0:45:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashima still hasn't showed up though!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.51,0:45:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, my brother is a bit busy.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:48.51,0:45:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Some things came up and he can't participate in circle activities for a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:53.61,0:45:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like he does anything anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:56.24,0:45:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi?!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:57.49,0:45:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, really?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:59.31,0:46:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to talk to him about next month's concert!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:01.98,0:46:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'll be managing Icy Tail–
Dialogue: 99,0:46:04.98,0:46:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I can deal with that somehow.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:07.53,0:46:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:09.90,0:46:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I might not be able to play hardball like he did,
Dialogue: 99,0:46:13.95,0:46:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but reserving music venues, coordination, and so on shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:18.84,0:46:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our leader has to focus on the script now more than ever, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:26.30,0:46:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:29.72,0:46:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're counting on you now!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:33.39,0:46:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You really took a load off us!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:56.23,0:46:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorry, we really dropped another stumbling block on you, huh?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:46:59.82,0:47:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:02.34,0:47:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he's doing\Nhere in the first place.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:07.19,0:47:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, he's pretty useless in\Nthe middle of development.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:12.37,0:47:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you implying he's useful elsewhere?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:16.22,0:47:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Megumi, it sounds like you\Nhate his guts more than I do.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:21.44,0:47:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:22.44,0:47:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the game coming along?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:25.20,0:47:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Smooth sailing...{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:27.23,0:47:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:29.48,0:47:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:32.87,0:47:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a close friend,\Nso there's no secrets here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:37.79,0:47:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened with Kousaka Akane\N hit us way too hard.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:42.25,0:47:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Doesn't the master have to be ready soon?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:44.45,0:47:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then you should be close to the finish line.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:47:46.93,0:47:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But there hasn't been a single review yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.07,0:47:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a thorough quality checking\Nprocess with revisions too.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:51.97,0:47:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things an artist\Nlike me just can't see.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:56.50,0:48:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But once you dig your heels in,\N nobody can convince you otherwise.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:01.17,0:48:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This game–
Dialogue: 99,0:48:02.78,0:48:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, this game can't just be my best,\N it has to be the world's best.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:09.28,0:48:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Failure is not an option for Sawamura Eriri or Kashiwagi Eri.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:14.03,0:48:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going all out right now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:16.10,0:48:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to become undisputed,\Nthe best artist there is!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:21.02,0:48:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wouldn't have left the circle if I wasn't.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:24.62,0:48:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wouldn't have left you and Tomoya.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:28.92,0:48:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:30.71,0:48:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you shouldn't worry about that.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:32.55,0:48:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how I view it.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:36.84,0:48:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're probably not alone in that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:39.77,0:48:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, maybe.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:41.17,0:48:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasumigaoka Utaha must feel the same way.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:45.35,0:48:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}All right, I have to get back to work.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:48.64,0:48:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, goodbye.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:50.50,0:48:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, right!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:52.00,0:48:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a day late, but Happy Birthday, Megumi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:55.66,0:48:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's celebrate it once the master's done!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,0:48:58.41,0:48:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:05.83,0:49:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Eriri.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:08.36,0:49:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is...
Dialogue: 99,0:49:10.21,0:49:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,another.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:13.99,0:49:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who's been\Nwatching you for ten years.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:23.72,0:49:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, the meeting with Mars went even worse than I thought it would.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:28.02,0:49:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't try to make it sound hopeless from the jump.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:31.59,0:49:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real mess, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:33.18,0:49:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving project management duties to\Na hardcore creative like Akane is never a good idea.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:39.49,0:49:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out and give me the news!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:41.88,0:49:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's bad news.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:45.20,0:49:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're way beyond Mars's\Noriginal deadline now.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:49.86,0:49:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, how did we get here?
Dialogue: 99,0:49:53.40,0:49:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The more Kashiwagi Eri and Kasumi Utako fought,\Nthe more they grew.
Dialogue: 99,0:49:59.18,0:50:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The more revisions were made, the greater their work became.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:03.82,0:50:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She couldn't get enough.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:09.12,0:50:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's recovery looking like?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:13.02,0:50:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One month.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:14.21,0:50:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That long?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:15.87,0:50:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mars doesn't have that much time.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:18.24,0:50:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll cut all the unfinished art,\Nevery incomplete event...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:22.52,0:50:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll make it work themselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:25.37,0:50:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The current materials should be enough to provide a sufficient product, they said.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:31.59,0:50:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen at this rate?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:34.74,0:50:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:36.17,0:50:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll ignore Akane and proceed with their own schedule and QC standards.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:42.76,0:50:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two can't do anything anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:47.02,0:50:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end to their Fields Chronicle XIII.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:50.44,0:50:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So you just let them roll over you, huh?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:52.36,0:50:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nowhere near satisfied!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:55.82,0:50:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:59.23,0:51:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how negotiations would have gone had Akane been there.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:02.28,0:51:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not the type who'd back down to corporate-speak.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:07.05,0:51:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Machida and I can't compare.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:09.75,0:51:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We simply can't disagree\Nwith the director's reasoning.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:15.42,0:51:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:17.74,0:51:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we even do anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:20.46,0:51:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not from here on out.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:22.43,0:51:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:23.18,0:51:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:25.17,0:51:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a part of Blessing Software.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:28.47,0:51:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You all did your best to get here.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:32.21,0:51:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you have to zero-in on
Dialogue: 99,0:51:34.26,0:51:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,supporting Izumi, Hyoudou and Katou.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:51.42,0:51:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:53.15,0:51:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just relayed what Machida told me.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:55.72,0:51:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Word for word.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:57.51,0:51:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 99,0:51:59.15,0:52:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have at least 10 pieces left!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:02.06,0:52:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And half of them need revisions!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:04.44,0:52:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only truly completed the main story.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:08.51,0:52:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still many side stories left.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:11.86,0:52:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't want to rely on Hashima!
Dialogue: 99,0:52:15.21,0:52:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is a victory for him.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:18.31,0:52:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, this means\Nwe are no longer working.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:22.53,0:52:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be compensated as written in the contract.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:24.84,0:52:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be penalized for missing deadlines.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:27.80,0:52:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In some ways, it's a total victory.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:30.48,0:52:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're actually going to call this a victory?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:35.75,0:52:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have a choice?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:36.99,0:52:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mars doesn't need us anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:40.27,0:52:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kousaka Akane is different.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:42.51,0:52:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But the idealism of some industry newcomers is just pain in the neck for something like Fields Chronicle.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:50.87,0:52:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So what should we do?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:53.39,0:52:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we make Mars hear us out?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:56.94,0:53:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do, so we can finish our work to the level that we strive for?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:01.64,0:53:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawamura.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:02.99,0:53:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! We can go to Osaka\Nand negotiate with the–
Dialogue: 99,0:53:06.22,0:53:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:08.01,0:53:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't conversationalists and we're prideful. That doesn't suit us.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:12.93,0:53:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It would devolve into a fight instantly.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:16.20,0:53:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who else could it be?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:21.68,0:53:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:23.23,0:53:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who believes in our skills from the bottom of his heart.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:27.85,0:53:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who believes it would be\Na masterpiece with ample time.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:32.98,0:53:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd get down on their knees,
Dialogue: 99,0:53:34.35,0:53:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,cry their eyes out, do everything they can because they believe in us.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:40.07,0:53:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:43.32,0:53:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one! And only one!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:12.20,0:54:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:13.71,0:54:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm up.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:19.51,0:54:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:20.69,0:54:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, leave it to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:32.89,0:54:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to school?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:35.87,0:54:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:39.83,0:54:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're going to Osaka?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:42.74,0:54:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:45.32,0:54:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,To go work on the game\Nwith Eriri and Kasumigaoka?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:51.23,0:54:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't, Fields Chronicle XIII will just be another good game.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:58.06,0:55:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A good game isn't enough?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:00.90,0:55:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be a masterpiece.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:03.68,0:55:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be the legendary game they promised.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:07.05,0:55:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that happen if you give them your all?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:12.50,0:55:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:15.29,0:55:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:16.62,0:55:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri and Utaha said that
Dialogue: 99,0:55:19.17,0:55:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they absolutely need my help.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:22.66,0:55:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you want to do.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:27.01,0:55:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're even throwing away\Nthe game we're working on.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:29.96,0:55:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to help them.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:33.09,0:55:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it yourself, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:35.72,0:55:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That we'll go all out, and make our own legendary game.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:41.71,0:55:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You said we'd make it together, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:44.86,0:55:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But Fields Chronicle XIII is their big chance to finally capture the spotlight!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:53.82,0:55:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But our game is our chance, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:55:59.62,0:56:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For one year, we gave it\Nour all and we finally got here.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:04.24,0:56:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Under our own spotlight.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:06.99,0:56:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Say.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:09.58,0:56:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I react now?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:12.89,0:56:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I get angry and cry like a selfish 3D girl?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:17.82,0:56:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I burden you in real life?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:21.77,0:56:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, should I
Dialogue: 99,0:56:23.24,0:56:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,see you off with a smile and wave goodbye, like a 2D main heroine?
Dialogue: 99,0:56:32.56,0:56:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:33.52,0:56:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:35.74,0:56:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be, it's all my fault.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:37.67,0:56:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:40.20,0:56:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But still.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:42.86,0:56:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:43.87,0:56:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,0:56:46.65,0:56:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 99,0:56:49.20,0:56:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't become your main heroine.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:03.02,0:57:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Taki?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:05.44,0:57:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Passion won't make a company budge an inch.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:08.65,0:57:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where Akane relied on her reputation to bulldoze her way through,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:12.40,0:57:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no choice but to rely on an all out assault.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:15.00,0:57:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about the most fitting proposal, showing its merits to the other party,
Dialogue: 99,0:57:19.93,0:57:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and force them to meet you in the middle.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:22.04,0:57:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And if an all out assault doesn't work?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:24.44,0:57:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you have to resort to passion.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:27.94,0:57:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Break down into tears, lash at them, threaten them.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:30.86,0:57:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Use everything you have to get your way.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:33.34,0:57:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you contradicting yourself?
Dialogue: 99,0:57:36.55,0:57:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Passion won't make a company budge an inch.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:39.09,0:57:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But passion does make people budge.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:42.47,0:57:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,People...
Dialogue: 99,0:57:43.91,0:57:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So it can't be me, it has to be you.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:48.49,0:57:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who would put his life on the line for Shi-Shi and Eri Kashiwagi's work.
Dialogue: 99,0:57:53.63,0:57:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It has to be you. Okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:58:07.69,0:58:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:11.77,0:58:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming, Mr. Ethical.
Dialogue: 99,0:58:14.39,0:58:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri, Utaha. I...
Dialogue: 99,0:58:17.42,0:58:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:20.35,0:58:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got us a two-week extension!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:22.54,0:58:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I was victorious!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:24.39,0:58:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why only two weeks?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:26.68,0:58:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We said we needed a month!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:29.10,0:58:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill us?!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:31.49,0:58:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I negotiated myself to death! How cruel!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:39.62,0:58:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes! That's the good stuff!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:42.74,0:58:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The party is almost done for!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:44.43,0:58:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, their old arch-enemy Guiel saves them!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:47.39,0:58:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm the only one allowed to defeat you!"
Dialogue: 99,0:58:49.32,0:58:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The most classic of classic moments!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:51.59,0:58:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, Guiel's portrait is just amazing!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:53.99,0:58:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so ordinary, yet outstanding!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:55.85,0:58:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a striking expression!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:04.57,0:59:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything so far was super gripping!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:07.49,0:59:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can make it an even greater masterpiece!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:12.72,0:59:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're cutting characters?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:15.43,0:59:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Namely Lute and Salacia.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:18.09,0:59:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best I could do.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:20.61,0:59:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with all the other cuts?
Dialogue: 99,0:59:22.30,0:59:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted to make it five.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:24.54,0:59:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I negotiated them down to two.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:26.78,0:59:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Five? That would definitely kill the story's flow and structure!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:31.74,0:59:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:32.79,0:59:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two have the least\Nimpact on the main narrative.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:36.78,0:59:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a key point in convincing Mars.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:40.04,0:59:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But we already created them.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:42.75,0:59:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I like their designs and stories too...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:46.31,0:59:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just set them aside for\Nthe remake in a few years.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:50.00,0:59:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That way we can repurpose them for hype later on.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:53.57,0:59:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds a bit sleazy.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:57.67,1:00:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally taking after Hashima!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:02.63,1:00:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've reached a compromise.\NThe main story will not be touched.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:07.33,1:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, the script will be expanded.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:11.96,1:00:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the outline for an additional scene Kousaka had in mind.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:16.30,1:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I visited her yesterday and took down all of her points of interest.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:19.76,1:00:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kousaka Akane?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:22.56,1:00:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't she be hospitalized at the moment?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:26.43,1:00:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:27.56,1:00:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Machida came along with me.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:27.56,1:00:30.56,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Wrong! Am I talking to a brick wall?!
Dialogue: 99,1:00:32.30,1:00:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've fulfilled your obligations towards Mars, you can do what you want.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:36.69,1:00:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get even closer to your Fields Chronicle XIII,
Dialogue: 99,1:00:40.01,1:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the one you and Kousaka Akane always wanted.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:43.50,1:00:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's get started.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:46.17,1:00:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's payback time.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:09.16,1:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:11.77,1:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Hyoudou?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:13.54,1:01:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I just put the bow on a sick track and thought you had to listen to it!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:18.82,1:01:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I just finished my best drawing yet!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:24.32,1:01:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle activities are on pause\Nfor now, didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:30.33,1:01:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time for that,\NWinter Comiket is just around the corner!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:33.86,1:01:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah! This is the home stretch, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:37.13,1:01:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Please direct your concerns to our president.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:41.97,1:01:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He is occupied for the next two weeks, he says.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:46.54,1:01:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:47.15,1:01:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because he's not around doesn't mean we should stop working!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:53.24,1:01:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:54.53,1:01:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you two can continue\Nworking solo for now.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:58.86,1:02:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:00.44,1:02:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was a time to pull together, it's now!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:05.84,1:02:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:09.70,1:02:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be finalized without our president.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:13.99,1:02:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:16.33,1:02:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you say that there's another dependable leader around here?!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:20.38,1:02:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:21.17,1:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! Hashima's brother is\Ntruly the greatest producer!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:28.87,1:02:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Michiru! Don't joke about that stuff!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:31.71,1:02:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! If you stay so uptight,\Nyou'll snap eventually!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:35.56,1:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you just stepped on a colossal landmine!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:38.55,1:02:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi! I meant you! Wait!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:56.33,1:02:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so great!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:58.20,1:03:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your tracks are totally godlike!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:01.17,1:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop! Praise me more!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:03.90,1:03:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only because your art is so inspiring, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:08.22,1:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Absolutely. It underlines the scene where Meguri and the protagonist become lovers{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:12.28,1:03:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}in a wonderfully sad way.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:14.11,1:03:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! I even got the director's OK!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:17.29,1:03:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The game's main climax is taking shape too!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:21.12,1:03:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only the script remains.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:24.71,1:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised that you wouldn't bring it up.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:27.74,1:03:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside,
Dialogue: 99,1:03:29.63,1:03:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,why aren't you coming down?!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:32.33,1:03:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the second floor, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:35.06,1:03:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to see you guys to do my job, so don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:39.94,1:03:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't it a pain?{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:42.01,1:03:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have to be exceedingly careful as the only man in this group, too.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:46.79,1:03:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tomo doesn't care about that though.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:49.61,1:03:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, we don't care about that either.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:53.35,1:03:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anyway,{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:54.72,1:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}allowing the creators to focus on their work without distractions is how I do things.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:03:59.75,1:04:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, that's surprisingly considerate.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:04.20,1:04:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've told you already, stop treating me like I'm a good person.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:04:09.27,1:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea why you're\Nstill hung up over that.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:13.02,1:04:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been fifteen years and I still don't get him.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:38.15,1:04:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so gross it's even making me dizzy.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:42.65,1:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:46.43,1:04:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 99,1:04:51.93,1:04:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,An essay containing pain beyond belief?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:57.56,1:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And? What is it?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:00.20,1:05:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A threat from a stalker?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:02.15,1:05:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The inner workings of a narcissist?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:04.32,1:05:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, it's embarrassing enough that I regret reading it.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:07.54,1:05:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,1:05:09.56,1:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is this your new game's script?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:13.58,1:05:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:15.19,1:05:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The main heroine Meguri's route.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:16.76,1:05:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:17.97,1:05:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, I had some free time\Nafter Eriri fell asleep so I–
Dialogue: 99,1:05:23.28,1:05:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't object.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:25.38,1:05:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your actual duty after all.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:30.43,1:05:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still gross?
Dialogue: 99,1:05:32.68,1:05:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:34.74,1:05:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kousaka told me it was good.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:37.68,1:05:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a weapon not even your pen could create.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:40.70,1:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just the experiences of a gross nerd.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:44.65,1:05:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not at all. It's just the\Nfantasies of a gross nerd.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:50.24,1:05:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:58.23,1:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't let up, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:00.06,1:06:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:04.82,1:06:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a circle meeting today, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:07.35,1:06:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed on it, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:09.31,1:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we're on a tight schedule!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:12.11,1:06:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Winter Comiket plans might be in danger.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:14.74,1:06:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Does that mean you're helping us?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:18.67,1:06:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:20.01,1:06:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,1:06:20.37,1:06:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing my job.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:23.29,1:06:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to think we\Nfailed solely because of him.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:28.55,1:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This will prove that we\Ncan do just fine without him.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:36.27,1:06:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Megumi!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:38.17,1:06:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll listen to you trash-talk Tomoya for as long as you want!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:41.93,1:06:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm legitimately angry though.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:00.72,1:07:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:02.27,1:07:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. Just taking a break.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:05.48,1:07:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's already this late.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:10.17,1:07:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how's it going on your end?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:12.50,1:07:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:16.08,1:07:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you did all this in two days?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:19.80,1:07:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you so surprised?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:21.35,1:07:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw me finish seven pieces in a day, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:24.30,1:07:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I also saw you pass out right after.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:28.73,1:07:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is incredible.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:31.81,1:07:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's different\Nabout me right now.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:35.23,1:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all. You're just improving.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:40.79,1:07:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it like that...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:43.95,1:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you mean then?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:45.99,1:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I always just wanted to draw.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:48.09,1:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:49.17,1:07:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you were next to me...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:51.16,1:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you were looking at me...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:53.34,1:07:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to draw.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:55.13,1:07:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:56.58,1:07:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big issue if you don't draw.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:58.66,1:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here after all!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:01.11,1:08:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:03.63,1:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:05.14,1:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once this game is wrapped up,
Dialogue: 99,1:08:09.74,1:08:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't it be nice to\Nwork together sometime?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:14.24,1:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've gotta.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:16.94,1:08:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll work together again.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:19.31,1:08:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give it my all, day in and day out, for as long as it takes!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:23.81,1:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can make you an offer one day.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:28.32,1:08:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:31.03,1:08:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting to become an artist\Nfor your game studio!
Dialogue: 99,1:08:37.47,1:08:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you already, didn't I?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:40.51,1:08:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm angry.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:42.04,1:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I was wrong to think that a president has any obligation towards their circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:45.85,1:08:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:47.21,1:08:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, it just seems like you're upset.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:50.41,1:08:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Tomo abandoned you,\Njust to be with Sawamura and Utaha.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:54.82,1:08:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd probably be thanks to\Nyour weird preconceptions.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:04.08,1:09:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, I believe we were discussing Meguri's feelings towards the protagonist?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:10.00,1:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how the topic shifted to me and the president, then.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:13.92,1:09:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's because you're totally hiding something!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:18.20,1:09:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:19.76,1:09:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Utaha's my only source,
Dialogue: 99,1:09:21.79,1:09:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but you guys have been\Nsecretly dating, haven't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:24.84,1:09:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow? Really?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:27.55,1:09:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:29.36,1:09:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That is definitely one of her weird rumours.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:33.44,1:09:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You were hiding your secret phone calls,
Dialogue: 99,1:09:36.01,1:09:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and sending lovey-dovey messages, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:38.37,1:09:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:39.51,1:09:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving him the cold shoulder.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:41.80,1:09:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you had a lovers' quarrel?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:44.07,1:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure sounds like you're going out to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:46.16,1:09:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:47.48,1:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all, Tomoya and I–
Dialogue: 99,1:09:49.54,1:09:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya?!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:50.84,1:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah, I knew it!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:52.06,1:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when have you been calling Tomo by his first name?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:54.79,1:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm loving this new side to you!
Dialogue: 99,1:09:58.97,1:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:01.40,1:10:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you two calling him by his first name or some nickname too?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:07.45,1:10:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You jealous?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:08.66,1:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:10.22,1:10:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you should stop drawing weird conclusions.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:19.46,1:10:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it, Izumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:21.03,1:10:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you get every single face she makes!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:25.48,1:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, ours will be the greatest!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:28.42,1:10:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest annoying main heroine of all time!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:31.74,1:10:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gotcha!{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:10:32.87,1:10:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I get why you're rushing it, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:36.20,1:10:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to rush over a guy I don't care about.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:41.09,1:10:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For Sawamura and Utaha,\Nhe's been their fate since day one.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:46.22,1:10:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been with him since I was a baby.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:50.29,1:10:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In comparison,
Dialogue: 99,1:10:52.60,1:10:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you and Tomo aren't exciting at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:56.23,1:10:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, aren't you forgetting me?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:00.13,1:11:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Kasumigaoka tell you that, too?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:03.19,1:11:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What if she did?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:05.35,1:11:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How about leaving me alone then?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:08.32,1:11:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would my opinion of Tomoya be her business anyways?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:15.29,1:11:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're ignoring us after all.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:18.67,1:11:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you lump me together with you!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:21.01,1:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:22.35,1:11:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Tomoya is a special\Nperson for every one of you,
Dialogue: 99,1:11:29.45,1:11:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he isn't one for me.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:33.74,1:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's normal.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:36.08,1:11:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So... I...
Dialogue: 99,1:11:42.27,1:11:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the last one.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:44.27,1:11:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:45.50,1:11:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfect!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:47.70,1:11:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mars can't complain about this!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:49.74,1:11:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 99,1:11:58.12,1:12:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:00.41,1:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:02.10,1:12:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Two weeks late, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:04.06,1:12:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky it was just that!
Dialogue: 99,1:12:06.96,1:12:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, our director certainly had some rose-coloured glasses.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:10.40,1:12:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:12.39,1:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,this is the greatest Fields Chronicle.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:16.10,1:12:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, it is.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:20.59,1:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You really had me pull out\Nall the stops this time around.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:24.32,1:12:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 99,1:12:26.27,1:12:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about a celebratory dinner?
Dialogue: 99,1:12:28.96,1:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking a break.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:31.26,1:12:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead tired, moving is a no-go.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:37.48,1:12:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time I headed back.\N
Dialogue: 99,1:12:40.50,1:12:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,At least stay for the after party.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:43.27,1:12:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gave you a hand.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:46.64,1:12:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,These two weeks are nothing compared to the months upon months Kousaka put into this.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:52.09,1:12:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this isn't my project.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:55.62,1:12:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But Blessing Software's latest title,
Dialogue: 99,1:12:58.76,1:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that's mine for sure.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:01.41,1:13:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,These last two weeks and the countless months I've put into that
Dialogue: 99,1:13:05.05,1:13:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,can't be compared.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:07.21,1:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:09.44,1:13:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi and the others might not think the same and you know it.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:13.67,1:13:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're unlucky, you might not even be in the credits anymore.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:17.12,1:13:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Better go make sure that doesn't happen then.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:21.56,1:13:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was seriously a great time.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:23.69,1:13:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget these two weeks.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:27.09,1:13:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll forget all about it once you start working on something new.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:31.56,1:13:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't try to butter us up so early, at least give it a year.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:37.70,1:13:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, then.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:39.35,1:13:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:43.13,1:13:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, he rushed back to his circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:45.92,1:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To Katou's side.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:47.74,1:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just returned to where he belongs.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:50.70,1:13:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't his realm, you know it.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:53.82,1:13:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any special skills,\Nhe hasn't been grinding away all this time.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:58.61,1:14:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't stop that total geek\Nfrom dreaming big, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:01.98,1:14:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like him working on Fields Chronicle is a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:07.26,1:14:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to honour\Nour side, as we promised.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:11.59,1:14:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:12.92,1:14:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go all out.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:14.80,1:14:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ensure he stays on the main heroine's route to the very end.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:20.76,1:14:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:22.15,1:14:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,One who believes in our abilities!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:25.78,1:14:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,One who would fall to his knees, cry his heart out and would do everything to help us!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:29.98,1:14:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Sawamura.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:32.65,1:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking Mr. Ethical for help is against the rules.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:35.43,1:14:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:14:36.50,1:14:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We betrayed him. We betrayed the circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:39.73,1:14:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They forgave us.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:41.55,1:14:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he would support us!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:44.39,1:14:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he and the circle are working on their new game right now.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:49.82,1:14:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing their utmost to not lose against us.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:53.14,1:14:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,By pulling him into this mess,
Dialogue: 99,1:14:56.51,1:15:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we also might end up crushing his dream.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:03.41,1:15:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't give up now or we'll break our promise!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:07.15,1:15:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We vowed to become amazing creators!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:13.31,1:15:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to rely on him, we have to do two things in return.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:20.10,1:15:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And those are?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:22.45,1:15:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is easy.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:24.99,1:15:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,After he helped us with our game,
Dialogue: 99,1:15:27.53,1:15:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we too have to help him with Blessing Software's new game.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:32.18,1:15:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a problem!
Dialogue: 99,1:15:33.96,1:15:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But, will the others accept us after we abandoned them?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:39.16,1:15:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt that will be an issue.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:43.64,1:15:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,At least compared to our second task.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:46.46,1:15:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean helping them with something else?
Dialogue: 99,1:15:48.97,1:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have to move a finger.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:52.43,1:15:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to be resolute.
Dialogue: 99,1:15:55.93,1:15:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we've finished our work on the game,
Dialogue: 99,1:15:58.95,1:16:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to
Dialogue: 99,1:16:01.22,1:16:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,support his love story.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:10.37,1:16:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:12.57,1:16:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you understand.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:14.69,1:16:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're dragging him into this,
Dialogue: 99,1:16:17.23,1:16:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the senior's route and the childhood friend's route are no longer an option.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:21.77,1:16:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is the turning point for the main heroine's route.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:28.18,1:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,His bond with her, Katou,
Dialogue: 99,1:16:30.79,1:16:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,will be tested and reinforced through this climactic event.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:35.40,1:16:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:37.06,1:16:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:38.31,1:16:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Her?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:39.71,1:16:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't believe me, why don't you get it from the horse's mouth?
Dialogue: 99,1:16:43.39,1:16:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"That ordinary girl couldn't possibly be in love with such a special guy."
Dialogue: 99,1:16:49.91,1:16:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:51.62,1:16:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 99,1:16:52.67,1:16:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you see him through this route,\Nwe will remain connected through our friendship.
Dialogue: 99,1:16:59.10,1:17:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,However, neither of us can become his one and only, chasing his dream with him.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:24.67,1:17:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kasumigaoka Utaha.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:27.47,1:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,For giving you such a painful duty.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:30.18,1:17:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My losing streak doesn't end, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:33.08,1:17:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:34.35,1:17:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're gloomy, a selfish schemer, but also...
Dialogue: 99,1:17:39.92,1:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dependable.\NYou're actually a softie, aren't you.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:47.72,1:17:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Our duty starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:50.93,1:17:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We will aid them in reconciliation.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:57.03,1:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That might not be necessary.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:00.96,1:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi is a lot more vindictive than one may think.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:05.03,1:18:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only because you hadn't noticed it.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:08.96,1:18:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a scheming, greedy, bothersome bitch.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:14.28,1:18:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearing that from the original bitch sure is convincing.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:18.84,1:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She will never give him up. Ever.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:22.72,1:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet she never quite tells him her feelings.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:25.26,1:18:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tease.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:26.84,1:18:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the other party's confession can defuse this ticking time bomb of a woman.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:32.47,1:18:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the messed up one here?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:40.96,1:18:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:43.46,1:18:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Something weird was sent my way an hour ago.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:46.57,1:18:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird how?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:49.65,1:18:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:18:51.10,1:18:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:53.03,1:18:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With Fields Chronicle and Kanou Meguri's route.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:56.50,1:18:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It grosses me out, really.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:01.96,1:19:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I put my thoughts about you into that route.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:05.89,1:19:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you actually think a disgusting confession like that would make any woman happy?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:11.01,1:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I honestly can't say.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:13.88,1:19:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe no one would be.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:17.35,1:19:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least,
Dialogue: 99,1:19:19.20,1:19:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can say it was the most resounding story my heart has ever seen!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:28.04,1:19:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:28.84,1:19:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:29.44,1:19:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a second!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:33.23,1:19:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how backlogged\Nwe are because of you?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:37.81,1:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 99,1:19:39.22,1:19:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey, I finished the script.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:41.95,1:19:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that's not enough for me to forgive you.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:45.74,1:19:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did you come here?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:47.80,1:19:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I didn't say it to your face again,\NI wouldn't be satisfied.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:52.60,1:19:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You cried because of me.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:54.86,1:19:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You cried back then, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:19:57.53,1:20:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I not, Tomoya?\NAfter you showed me your selfish vision.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:03.16,1:20:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 99,1:20:04.88,1:20:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still using my first name.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:09.52,1:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just treat you like a stranger,\Neven though I'm this upset.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:19.18,1:20:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:27.73,1:20:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:33.07,1:20:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about anything.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:36.50,1:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't forgive you, but I don't care.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:41.29,1:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Because—
Dialogue: 99,1:20:43.28,1:20:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 99,1:20:44.88,1:20:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,love you.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:47.56,1:20:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I love Kanou Meguri and our 2D main heroines, too.
Dialogue: 99,1:20:53.17,1:20:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love the real Katou Megumi the most.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:01.17,1:21:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:05.43,1:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not them?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:08.70,1:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can only convey my true feelings to a single girl.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:15.70,1:21:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have to put on airs or be obstinate.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:18.43,1:21:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't look up to you, nor am I obsessed with you.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:22.05,1:21:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the main heroine that's revered by everyone,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:24.98,1:21:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but for me, I can reach out and touch you.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:28.28,1:21:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So we can make it work, some way!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:31.91,1:21:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think a woman would be happy to hear that?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:36.93,1:21:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's no way, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:40.19,1:21:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No normal one.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:44.12,1:21:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:46.56,1:21:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:49.09,1:21:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you passed.
Dialogue: 99,1:21:53.40,1:21:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Tomoya is a special\Nperson for every one of you,
Dialogue: 99,1:21:59.39,1:22:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but he isn't one for me.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:03.83,1:22:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's normal.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:06.88,1:22:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I thought he could be the one.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:13.27,1:22:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You might not understand me.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:15.90,1:22:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be repulsed by me.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:18.68,1:22:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't care about that!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:20.90,1:22:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mine!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:30.63,1:22:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, M-Megu-Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:33.65,1:22:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite easy to reach, no?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, y-yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:40.06,1:22:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you love me,
Dialogue: 99,1:22:43.48,1:22:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,why did you leave to help Eriri anyway?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:46.98,1:22:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:48.67,1:22:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you run to Kasumigaoka's side?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:53.66,1:22:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:55.27,1:23:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you weren't obsessed with those two, you wouldn't be you.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:02.15,1:23:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 99,1:23:04.90,1:23:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:38.33,1:23:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, I'm s-sorry!
Dialogue: 99,1:23:42.34,1:23:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I misread your signal.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:44.51,1:23:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were okay with it since your eyes were closed.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:50.16,1:23:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:51.69,1:23:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, I know, I was too sudden.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:56.66,1:23:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't read the mo—
Dialogue: 99,1:24:04.08,1:24:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't wrong, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:07.24,1:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your timing was just off.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:10.15,1:24:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything else was perfect.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:16.24,1:24:19.05,Default,TM,0,0,0,,It's just what I wanted.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:21.85,1:24:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, together this time.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:24.45,1:24:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:25.66,1:24:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:44.08,1:24:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be discharged next week?
Dialogue: 99,1:24:45.81,1:24:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can already move my right hand this much.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:49.55,1:24:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like your left hand is evolving.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:52.31,1:24:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my right one is fully healed, I can double my productivity!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:56.93,1:25:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you won't be able to\Nbounce back like this again.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:01.30,1:25:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked out the beta.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:04.97,1:25:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:05.91,1:25:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like it was a ride, huh? I'm not satisfied at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:09.18,1:25:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You only hit about 70% of my target.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:12.80,1:25:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the limit without you around.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:15.53,1:25:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your peak without me, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:21.48,1:25:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:26.76,1:25:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? How's your circle going?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:29.59,1:25:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you make Winter Comiket?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:31.49,1:25:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right in the middle of production hell.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:34.31,1:25:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess me being here doesn't help.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:37.64,1:25:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I'll help you next week!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:39.48,1:25:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take it easy for a bit!
Dialogue: 99,1:25:41.39,1:25:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'd totally throw off the circle's hierarchy! We'll be fine alone.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:48.32,1:25:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I better descend back into hell.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:55.27,1:25:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya, bud.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:57.50,1:26:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, when our paths happen to cross.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:00.66,1:26:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They definitely will.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:02.61,1:26:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be coming to our side, after all.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:06.05,1:26:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll fight, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:07.57,1:26:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To catch Kashiwagi Eri and Kasumi Utako.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:11.47,1:26:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can hold my ground on that side?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:16.13,1:26:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that bad at giving up, you'll at least survive in this hellhole of an industry.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:21.14,1:26:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Iori.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:22.40,1:26:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:23.98,1:26:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're interested, I'll look at your proposals.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:27.36,1:26:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's yours, I'll definitely read it. \NEven if I might miss deadlines.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:31.59,1:26:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You would?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:33.01,1:26:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll criticize you so hard your heart will shatter into pieces!
Dialogue: 99,1:26:40.74,1:26:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't even look up\Nif we see each other outside!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:01.09,1:27:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:02.57,1:27:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:03.61,1:27:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The lines in this scene are for Meguri, but do they really fit?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:08.37,1:27:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it spelling?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:09.38,1:27:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,More than that, it doesn't seem like it fits with the rest of the dialogue.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:12.89,1:27:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we missing some?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:17.82,1:27:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:18.87,1:27:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:20.61,1:27:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:23.10,1:27:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh wow, what a tense atmosphere.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:27:25.65,1:27:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why co-worker relationships are a no-no.{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:27:28.13,1:27:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I told yo—{\i0}
Dialogue: 99,1:27:29.09,1:27:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:30.37,1:27:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, don't let something this boring distract you or the master won't get done in time.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:38.02,1:27:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, it's the final stretch!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:40.53,1:27:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The last scene and the epilogue\Nneed seven pieces total.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:43.76,1:27:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't that more than yesterday?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:46.69,1:27:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have yourself to blame!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:48.41,1:27:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meguri is way too cute to not draw.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:51.28,1:27:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In particular, these bits\Nyou looked at earlier are insane!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:55.81,1:27:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Look! After their first attempt at kissing failed,
Dialogue: 99,1:27:58.27,1:28:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}they retried their kiss, with Meguri taking the lead.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:03.67,1:28:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,After witnessing this back and forth,\NI just had to draw more of it!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:07.99,1:28:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we'll miss the deadline,\Nthere's no way I can stop now!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:12.27,1:28:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we can't afford to be late.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:14.75,1:28:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Izumi's part seems to be volatile, as expected.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:19.56,1:28:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We completely understand the situation!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:21.71,1:28:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No fear, for we are here!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:26.32,1:28:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been barging in here daily recently.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:29.64,1:28:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Fields Chronicle coming along?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:32.98,1:28:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfectly. We're pros, we wouldn't do something as unseemly as being late.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:37.44,1:28:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you just dumping your delays on us?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:40.05,1:28:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, those are all of today's finished line drawings?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:42.97,1:28:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll colour them for you then!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:44.54,1:28:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! The chair's too tiny!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:46.80,1:28:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Can't you just work from home?
Dialogue: 99,1:28:49.70,1:28:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no commute there either!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:51.44,1:28:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?!
Dialogue: 99,1:28:52.62,1:28:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of multitasking? We can brainstorm and work at the same time.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:58.67,1:29:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the closing theme's lyrics, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:00.72,1:29:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll revise that as well.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:03.61,1:29:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine! You just keep nitpicking it every day!
Dialogue: 99,1:29:07.00,1:29:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your lyrics might be emotional,\Nbut they're still rough around the edges!
Dialogue: 99,1:29:11.72,1:29:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you go focus on debugging instead?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:39.58,1:29:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're out here, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:41.16,1:29:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I needed some air.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:43.20,1:29:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's winter already.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:45.15,1:29:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can feel her passion, that Hashima Izumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:48.13,1:29:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She's impressive, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:50.30,1:29:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,With me to imitate, how could she not be?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:54.15,1:29:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you and Kousaka Akane?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:58.41,1:30:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I got here by myself.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:03.11,1:30:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I fought to the bitter end at the Nasu plateau.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:07.86,1:30:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:08.85,1:30:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you apologizing for a year-old issue?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:13.43,1:30:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That was for everything back then, but also for everything up to now.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:17.31,1:30:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And from now on. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:21.69,1:30:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for not becoming your rival 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:26.64,1:30:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for getting jealous after seeing you progress, and for surrendering to you.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:32.16,1:30:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,1:30:33.93,1:30:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for blaming our relationship's deterioration on you.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:38.62,1:30:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 99,1:30:40.35,1:30:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this now?
Dialogue: 99,1:30:44.18,1:30:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I didn't understand people's feelings.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:47.90,1:30:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a sad nerd who was inconsiderate towards his friend.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:50.90,1:30:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You still are.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:53.12,1:30:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:55.06,1:30:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you made up with that sad nerd.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:59.77,1:31:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So, thank you.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:01.66,1:31:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a sad nerd like you.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:05.78,1:31:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:12.31,1:31:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotten cold, so I'll head back.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:14.45,1:31:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 99,1:31:16.60,1:31:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another thing I have to tell you!
Dialogue: 99,1:31:23.05,1:31:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That you took advantage of your position as president to get closer to the main heroine?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:28.49,1:31:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That you're dating Megumi?
Dialogue: 99,1:31:32.43,1:31:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Actually, I-I wanted—
Dialogue: 99,1:31:35.40,1:31:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can save it.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:38.26,1:31:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know already.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:41.23,1:31:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm headed back in then.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:56.14,1:31:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:00.71,1:32:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you love me?
Dialogue: 99,1:32:06.80,1:32:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago,
Dialogue: 99,1:32:08.63,1:32:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,did you love me?
Dialogue: 99,1:32:16.59,1:32:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:22.89,1:32:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares, who cares!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:26.57,1:32:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares!
Dialogue: 99,1:32:35.27,1:32:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:42.57,1:32:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to take a bath.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:47.79,1:32:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:51.43,1:32:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take one together.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:59.19,1:33:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Eriri.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:01.20,1:33:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,F-For what?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:03.31,1:33:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I did something terrible to you.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:07.03,1:33:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you two had feelings for each other in those ten years.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:13.99,1:33:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them may have been painful,\Nsome unpleasant.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:18.80,1:33:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But beyond those, many were precious.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:24.04,1:33:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:26.27,1:33:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah, it sure was ten years of up and down.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:29.65,1:33:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll accept all of your criticism.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:33.03,1:33:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you'll hate me for the next ten years.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:36.84,1:33:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:40.60,1:33:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Eri—
Dialogue: 99,1:33:48.88,1:33:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,God, just how much do you love him?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:52.56,1:33:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,T-That's—
Dialogue: 99,1:33:55.54,1:34:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgave that traitor instantly,\Nand before you know it, you're dating him.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:00.52,1:34:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even have time to help you.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:03.53,1:34:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri...
Dialogue: 99,1:34:05.00,1:34:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Though that sure is something coming from the one who had him betray you.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:09.46,1:34:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:17.58,1:34:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, you and Tomoya, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:21.28,1:34:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure didn't take him for the guy an ordinary girl would fall for.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:27.68,1:34:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,True, maybe he isn't your typical guy.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:32.28,1:34:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's not a genius like you or Kasumigaoka either.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:37.25,1:34:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,From a talent perspective rather than a personality one, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:42.02,1:34:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:44.42,1:34:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither me nor Tomoya could\Never catch up to you two,
Dialogue: 99,1:34:48.37,1:34:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so we were perfect for each other.
Dialogue: 99,1:34:52.08,1:34:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 99,1:34:54.76,1:35:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He told me. That with me, it might work out,\Nor something along those lines.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:01.36,1:35:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,1:35:02.89,1:35:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally you'd break up with somebody after they said that.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:08.50,1:35:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,True, I might not be a normal girl who falls for normal guys.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:17.45,1:35:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,1:35:23.72,1:35:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 99,1:35:53.23,1:35:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:55.05,1:35:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, we've fulfilled our duty towards the circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:35:57.94,1:36:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Our new project is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:00.97,1:36:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no time to waste on him anymore.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:04.21,1:36:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the new project get approved?
Dialogue: 99,1:36:06.84,1:36:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a new series from the Fields Chronicle duo.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:11.22,1:36:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fantastic Books could never turn that down.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:14.59,1:36:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:16.88,1:36:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So make sure you look forward to it, okay?
Dialogue: 99,1:36:21.93,1:36:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:22.57,1:36:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop now.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:24.66,1:36:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him catch up to you.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:31.69,1:36:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. He'll definitely come running after us.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:38.71,1:36:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he without a doubt,
Dialogue: 99,1:36:41.93,1:36:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,adores us.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:45.42,1:36:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:47.69,1:36:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's Kashiwagi Eri or Kasumi Utako.
Dialogue: 99,1:36:52.79,1:36:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about us.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:00.71,1:37:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what stands in his way,\Nhe'll keep coming after us.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:08.71,1:37:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,As a fan who's worshipping outstanding artists.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:13.05,1:37:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And as a rival, trying to catch up to them.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:17.46,1:37:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:18.97,1:37:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:20.82,1:37:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 99,1:37:24.40,1:37:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for him.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:28.50,1:37:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:30.61,1:37:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go all in, pull out all the stops for him.
Dialogue: 99,1:37:52.28,1:37:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're late!
Dialogue: 99,1:37:56.68,1:38:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to waste time on those promotional flyers.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:01.93,1:38:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been fine if the printer worked!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:05.22,1:38:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't it be your duty to factor in such unexpected situations, Mr. President?
Dialogue: 99,1:38:10.28,1:38:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the blame, okay?\NWe have to get going!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:13.95,1:38:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though everything for the master was submitted on time,
Dialogue: 99,1:38:18.36,1:38:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a mess until the very end.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:20.90,1:38:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'll take the blame,\Nbut that comes later! Later!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:24.67,1:38:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it really?
Dialogue: 99,1:38:28.12,1:38:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No time for that!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:35.33,1:38:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is already our second Winter Comiket, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:38:38.42,1:38:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:39.51,1:38:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a true battle this time!
Dialogue: 99,1:38:42.53,1:38:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope a lot of people come by.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:48.09,1:38:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe 2000 copies were too many.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:51.16,1:38:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope the main heroine gets really popular.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:54.45,1:38:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She totally will.
Dialogue: 99,1:38:56.32,1:38:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I found
Dialogue: 99,1:38:59.67,1:39:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the most adorable girl ever!
Dialogue: 99,1:39:18.75,1:39:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:40:38.30,1:40:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me?
Dialogue: 99,1:40:39.77,1:40:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I become the main heroine you always wanted?
Dialogue: 99,1:40:47.28,1:40:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for an audience,
Dialogue: 99,1:40:50.85,1:40:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but for one person.
Dialogue: 99,1:40:58.30,1:41:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I become your main heroine?
Dialogue: 99,1:44:10.01,1:44:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it would be better for both of us to break up.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:16.02,1:44:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Why? Why would you want that?
Dialogue: 99,1:44:21.38,1:44:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we haven't seen each other at all recently.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:25.03,1:44:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you so many times.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:26.90,1:44:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to work Saturdays too, so I can't find the time.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:30.92,1:44:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't adjusted to this sales job.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:35.07,1:44:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After you threw away your life-long dream of becoming a creator.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:38.98,1:44:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 99,1:44:40.76,1:44:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't have the talent.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:46.30,1:44:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How many years have I kept you waiting?
Dialogue: 99,1:44:50.26,1:44:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I should stop dreaming my life away.
Dialogue: 99,1:44:54.55,1:44:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say this is my fault?
Dialogue: 99,1:44:59.34,1:45:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I ask you to do that?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:02.11,1:45:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I restrict you?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:05.73,1:45:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I was saying.
Dialogue: 99,1:45:07.71,1:45:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:10.82,1:45:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's what you're telling yourself, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:14.11,1:45:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:18.98,1:45:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You still can't forget that person, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:26.92,1:45:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home.
Dialogue: 99,1:45:29.34,1:45:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi!
Dialogue: 99,1:45:31.51,1:45:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be chasing that dream together anymore, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:50.75,1:45:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 99,1:45:54.18,1:45:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Iori.
Dialogue: 99,1:45:56.98,1:45:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're rent-dodging again, eh?
Dialogue: 99,1:45:58.93,1:46:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it a loan collector?
Dialogue: 99,1:46:01.72,1:46:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a woman.
Dialogue: 99,1:46:04.00,1:46:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I might be making a comeback.\NI had an elite sales pitch.
Dialogue: 99,1:46:11.06,1:46:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The client thought it was interesting too.
Dialogue: 99,1:46:13.53,1:46:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We were one step away to signing the contract when—
Dialogue: 99,1:46:17.01,1:46:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They caught wind of your past escapades from somewhere?
Dialogue: 99,1:46:19.78,1:46:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Or something like that.
Dialogue: 99,1:46:21.76,1:46:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well now that we're here,\Nhow about you try and sell it somewhere?
Dialogue: 99,1:46:27.48,1:46:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With this outline,
Dialogue: 99,1:46:29.22,1:46:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll make the greatest game.\NJust like the old days.
Dialogue: 99,1:46:35.01,1:46:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go chasing your dreams like an idiot.
Dialogue: 99,1:47:03.77,1:47:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ethical?
Dialogue: 99,1:47:08.58,1:47:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:47:11.15,1:47:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ethical.
Dialogue: 99,1:47:12.04,1:47:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Tomoya!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:15.01,1:47:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Utaha.
Dialogue: 99,1:47:28.22,1:47:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the singer, are you?!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:31.26,1:47:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:33.33,1:47:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:38.84,1:47:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,H-H-H-H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:39.41,1:47:41.85,Alternative,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 99,1:47:42.45,1:47:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? What kind of scheme are you cooking up this time?
Dialogue: 99,1:47:45.67,1:47:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you like it? This is my greatest masterpiece,
Dialogue: 99,1:47:50.11,1:47:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and the plot of Blessing Software's latest game:
Dialogue: 99,1:47:52.69,1:47:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How to Raise a Boring Girlfriend: Finale.
Dialogue: 99,1:47:55.74,1:47:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sick fantasies are all over both the movie and the epilogue,
Dialogue: 99,1:47:59.02,1:48:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,calling it criminal would be an understatement!
Dialogue: 99,1:48:00.90,1:48:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me sweat in multiple ways!
Dialogue: 99,1:48:04.92,1:48:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My role is fairly scummy, not that I dislike it.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:08.64,1:48:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As always, your preferences are a mystery.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:11.96,1:48:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the plot's done, we can start nailing down \Nthe art and development schedule.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:17.49,1:48:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything can be nailed to this joke of a plan.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:20.55,1:48:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why make it a continuation of the titles we made in our fan game years?
Dialogue: 99,1:48:24.87,1:48:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It even retcons the original happy endings those games had!
Dialogue: 99,1:48:27.85,1:48:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The protagonist could have died in a car accident for all it's worth.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:32.11,1:48:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I am, having pulled\Nan all-nighter to write this.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:35.56,1:48:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that bit really shines through in the script.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:38.61,1:48:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the new main heroine
Dialogue: 99,1:48:41.20,1:48:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the gloomy, overly-attached senior?
Dialogue: 99,1:48:43.86,1:48:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the brave, blonde childhood friend go?
Dialogue: 99,1:48:46.95,1:48:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd absolutely write that route— for the right price.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:50.44,1:48:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, two million yen should be fine...
Dialogue: 99,1:48:54.38,1:48:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can scrape that together, probably.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:56.51,1:48:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay her a dime.
Dialogue: 99,1:48:59.66,1:49:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how small and trivial the company who contracted you may be,
Dialogue: 99,1:49:04.76,1:49:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you should take the job seriously.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:08.22,1:49:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Your biases are seeping into your work.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:10.57,1:49:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did I research the company's past work and trends,
Dialogue: 99,1:49:14.19,1:49:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but I also tailor-made my plot to its audience.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:17.42,1:49:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear excuses.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:20.43,1:49:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to communicate with the other party to finalize our direction.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:25.77,1:49:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always going to do so.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:29.29,1:49:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially now that they're such an established and popular company...
Dialogue: 99,1:49:34.02,1:49:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't react like that.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:36.32,1:49:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the client here.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:39.75,1:49:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:43.22,1:49:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally here again, aren't I?
Dialogue: 99,1:49:47.28,1:49:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It took a while, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:50.05,1:49:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly didn't feel that long.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:53.36,1:49:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It all went by in the blink of an eye for us.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:57.69,1:49:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,1:49:59.99,1:50:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:01.69,1:50:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Mr. Ethical.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:04.36,1:50:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 99,1:50:13.60,1:50:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How did the meeting with Eriri and the others go—
Dialogue: 99,1:50:17.25,1:50:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomoya?
Dialogue: 99,1:50:18.88,1:50:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Megumi, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:21.26,1:50:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't leave me, right? You wouldn't throw me away or anything like that, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:50:25.38,1:50:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume one of them\Nhad a particularly cruel script?
Dialogue: 99,1:50:28.21,1:50:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasumigaoka, maybe?
Dialogue: 99,1:50:30.77,1:50:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hit the nail on the head like that.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:37.28,1:50:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our dream is finally becoming reality.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:41.78,1:50:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, hearing it from you just can't be beat.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:46.21,1:50:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That script must've been heavily traumatic, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:50:49.62,1:50:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, once that project takes off,\Nthings will get busy for sure.
Dialogue: 99,1:50:53.42,1:50:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been busy ever since you started making games.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:00.87,1:51:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Director.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:04.70,1:51:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Same for you, Scriptwriter.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:09.42,1:51:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those two to good use, Vice President.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:13.15,1:51:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be tempted by them either, Mr. President.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:17.69,1:51:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do our best.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:19.06,1:51:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever will we do if we don't?
Dialogue: 99,1:51:26.34,1:51:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get home first.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:30.42,1:51:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? It's open.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:33.19,1:51:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 99,1:51:35.23,1:51:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, welcome home.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:36.96,1:51:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Tomoya, Megumi.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:40.58,1:51:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you two here?!
Dialogue: 99,1:51:43.21,1:51:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A great lyric just hit me like a bolt of lightning!
Dialogue: 99,1:51:47.24,1:51:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just let that pass.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:49.72,1:51:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of a really great character design, too!
Dialogue: 99,1:51:52.26,1:51:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just leave that behind.
Dialogue: 99,1:51:53.97,1:51:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The office is the other apartment!
Dialogue: 99,1:51:55.91,1:51:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're not even working anyway!
Dialogue: 99,1:51:57.98,1:52:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, we would work in your apartment all the time back then.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:02.49,1:52:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a company now, not a circle.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:04.80,1:52:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mix official and private affairs!
Dialogue: 99,1:52:06.09,1:52:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we shouldn't? Look who's talking!
Dialogue: 99,1:52:09.88,1:52:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, that's—
Dialogue: 99,1:52:11.37,1:52:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, who's talking?!
Dialogue: 99,1:52:13.79,1:52:15.79,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Is it you?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:15.79,1:52:17.23,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Are you? Huh, are you?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:17.23,1:52:18.62,Alternative,,0,0,0,,Are you the one talking?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:18.62,1:52:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The tableware and interior design aren't Tomoya's style at all.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:23.32,1:52:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eriri.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:27.86,1:52:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A pass, but it's close.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:30.64,1:52:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you should be doing on your first visit to someone's place?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:33.77,1:52:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the frosty attitude, Katou?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:36.68,1:52:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, these two are working with us again from here on out, remember?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:42.57,1:52:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, give me a break.
Dialogue: 99,1:52:45.65,1:52:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, "these {\i1}two{\i0}"?
Dialogue: 99,1:52:55.86,1:53:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome home. I thought I would take one first, Katou.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:00.36,1:53:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Kasumigaoka.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:02.67,1:53:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How long has it been\Nsince everyone was together?
Dialogue: 99,1:53:06.38,1:53:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go all out tonight!\NCall your brother too!
Dialogue: 99,1:53:09.67,1:53:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 99,1:53:10.65,1:53:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of the ingredients already.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:15.00,1:53:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry!
Dialogue: 99,1:53:17.16,1:53:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:20.14,1:53:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure are loud.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:23.17,1:53:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:26.15,1:53:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, go entertain the others.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:30.03,1:53:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do all of this—
Dialogue: 99,1:53:31.91,1:53:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't even do that...
Dialogue: 99,1:53:36.15,1:53:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold this.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:38.38,1:53:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It really has been a while since we were last together.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:44.98,1:53:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure has!
Dialogue: 99,1:53:45.92,1:53:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's get this meeting started,\Nafter so many years.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:49.96,1:53:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:51.69,1:53:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I am annoyed that we were disturbed, though.
Dialogue: 99,1:53:56.47,1:53:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll take that from you in advance.
Dialogue: 99,1:54:04.65,1:54:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here it comes!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:06.24,1:54:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept us waiting!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:07.57,1:54:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to starve us?
Dialogue: 99,1:54:10.02,1:54:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a sweet ten seconds, huh?
Dialogue: 99,1:54:13.70,1:54:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not going to get to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:54:17.64,1:54:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have some decency.
Dialogue: 99,1:54:20.35,1:54:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's begin!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:25.33,1:54:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's celebrate the completion of the Blessing Software team!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:29.39,1:54:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:38.27,1:54:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 99,1:54:39.29,1:54:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work everyone!
