Dialogue: 10,1:41:25.74,1:41:29.51,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}namae wo yobu sono koe mo
Dialogue: 10,1:41:29.51,1:41:33.75,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}massugu yume wo miteru hitomi mo
