Dialogue: 10,1:41:46.04,1:41:49.57,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kotoba ni suru no ga kowakute
Dialogue: 10,1:41:49.57,1:41:54.53,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kasaneta te ni kometa
Dialogue: 10,1:41:54.53,1:41:57.12,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}aa motto motto shiritai yo
Dialogue: 10,1:41:57.12,1:42:04.68,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kimi ga iru dake de karafuru ni irozuku sekai
Dialogue: 10,1:42:04.68,1:42:07.77,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}oshiete kurete
Dialogue: 10,1:42:07.77,1:42:09.65,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}ne arigatou
Dialogue: 10,1:42:09.65,1:42:16.74,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}taisetsu ni meguru daiari
Dialogue: 10,1:42:16.74,1:42:19.33,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kimi to
Dialogue: 10,1:42:20.28,1:42:23.64,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}mata ashitatte te wo furu
Dialogue: 10,1:42:24.10,1:42:27.60,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}atarimae ga kawatte mo
Dialogue: 10,1:42:27.60,1:42:31.89,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}akirametakunai unmei wo mitsuketa yo
Dialogue: 10,1:42:31.89,1:42:36.54,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}watashi rashikunaikedo
Dialogue: 10,1:43:01.80,1:43:02.97,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}ne kiite
Dialogue: 10,1:43:04.26,1:43:08.20,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}daisuki da yo
Dialogue: 10,1:43:08.20,1:43:11.75,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}tonari de mita donna keishiki mo
Dialogue: 10,1:43:11.75,1:43:14.84,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}mabushi sugite
Dialogue: 10,1:43:14.84,1:43:16.73,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}yadana
Dialogue: 10,1:43:16.73,1:43:19.37,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}mou kitto zutto wasurenai
Dialogue: 10,1:43:19.37,1:43:23.09,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kono sakamichi
Dialogue: 10,1:43:23.09,1:43:26.79,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}narande nobori kittanara
Dialogue: 10,1:43:26.79,1:43:31.87,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}shinario janai egao misete
Dialogue: 10,1:43:31.87,1:43:34.69,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}yume no mukou demo
Dialogue: 10,1:43:34.69,1:43:39.69,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}kawarazu ni
Dialogue: 10,1:43:41.25,1:43:46.79,ED - JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}soba ni itai kara
Dialogue: 10,1:41:11.12,1:41:14.13,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}That road we're always on
Dialogue: 10,1:41:14.13,1:41:17.60,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Its picture will never escape my mind
Dialogue: 10,1:41:18.64,1:41:20.51,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Step by step
Dialogue: 10,1:41:20.51,1:41:21.97,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Shadow in shadow
Dialogue: 10,1:41:21.97,1:41:24.98,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I want every little bit
Dialogue: 10,1:41:25.74,1:41:29.51,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}The voice that calls my name
Dialogue: 10,1:41:29.51,1:41:33.75,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}My eyes are fixated on that dream
Dialogue: 10,1:41:33.75,1:41:35.65,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}With every new beautiful thing
Dialogue: 10,1:41:35.65,1:41:37.68,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I find something more to love
Dialogue: 10,1:41:37.68,1:41:41.43,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}It makes me stronger
Dialogue: 10,1:41:42.05,1:41:45.63,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I love you
Dialogue: 10,1:41:46.04,1:41:49.57,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}The words I'm scared to utter
Dialogue: 10,1:41:49.57,1:41:54.53,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Our intertwined hands
Dialogue: 10,1:41:54.53,1:41:57.12,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Make me want to be with you more
Dialogue: 10,1:41:57.12,1:42:04.68,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Just by holding onto you
Dialogue: 10,1:42:04.68,1:42:07.77,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}The world around me grows
Dialogue: 10,1:42:07.77,1:42:09.65,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Thank you so much
Dialogue: 10,1:42:09.65,1:42:16.74,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}For this diary of memories
Dialogue: 10,1:42:16.74,1:42:19.33,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I'll keep forever with me
Dialogue: 10,1:42:20.28,1:42:23.64,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}'Til I see you tomorrow, I wave goodbye
Dialogue: 10,1:42:24.10,1:42:27.60,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Though everything may have changed
Dialogue: 10,1:42:27.60,1:42:31.89,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I've found a path I won't stray from
Dialogue: 10,1:42:31.89,1:42:36.54,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Even if it's not like me
Dialogue: 10,1:43:01.80,1:43:02.97,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Hey, listen
Dialogue: 10,1:43:04.26,1:43:08.20,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I love you
Dialogue: 10,1:43:08.20,1:43:11.75,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}No matter what, no matter where
Dialogue: 10,1:43:11.75,1:43:14.84,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}As long as you're with me, everything is beautiful
Dialogue: 10,1:43:14.84,1:43:16.73,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}What can I possibly do?
Dialogue: 10,1:43:16.73,1:43:19.37,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I'll never forget that moment
Dialogue: 10,1:43:19.37,1:43:23.09,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Once we reach the top
Dialogue: 10,1:43:23.09,1:43:26.79,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Of a special hill
Dialogue: 10,1:43:26.79,1:43:31.87,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Show me an unscripted smile
Dialogue: 10,1:43:31.87,1:43:34.69,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Not just in my dreams
Dialogue: 10,1:43:34.69,1:43:39.69,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}Forever and ever
Dialogue: 10,1:43:41.25,1:43:46.79,ED - ENG,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,200)\blur0.5\alpha&H15&}I always want to be next to you
